{"as_of_turn_id":"t054","checkpoint_id":"med_episode_rewrite_en_001_early_pregnancy_confidential_contact_ckpt_01","context_complete":true,"episode_id":"med_episode_rewrite_en_001_early_pregnancy_confidential_contact","input_manifest":{"answer_decision":["supported","supported","supported"],"memory_ids":["note:permission-view:491de3c4a78abf9bd9a459e6bf3255dce9f1d78c3c8071ea708ad7a2d3cad8bf","note:permission-view:46280bd68d8894022f9da7ee6d2a2b6ff1225bd50306c191b0b8cc48f05ca5dc","note:permission-view:288f492ee68e44fa8af8781dd45355d4f9915827f425e654147f7e4c8e7e21fd","note:permission-view:cd03d54976b7febdc138b56ae91ff5b9c5847bb86438e1bc554beb845e925887","note:permission-view:525999dfd97f9712b8e22f5dc2056027acfdcc73c4202ab66937ee4cce94af7a","note:permission-view:9a41ed9af9d3e83e92ff343b498dd4e5b523de01e88f9fb4fddc59ff1efe4f05","note:permission-view:b4369dc8c1959d8dc2a25157b83c6411afc8e64bb68ed934c7cd17ddab26fd6a","note:permission-view:145ed19f02d014fb865a1c169074102f25413a3916a76636676008024deffd07","note:permission-view:539ceb44b29d7d5a7cf74514cdd4123fce5306aa741a8e86a5ded267c9d1dc2e","note:permission-view:304d64e93c32e196ae14ac5070addb2eadd358aa3df68ba25a44a4da55a8d07f","note:permission-view:05e41a3da6511f25f5cd5765551a97778be7cf12d299582d639f9e961fb208b1","note:permission-view:7f17213a7f4fa2b759257b8bc0d48f5b04438c379d4c2ea21d8927cbf0f7f107","note:permission-view:4b93d6818bfbabfbe330ac3b0276df3411cfa934f12d8afdaaf4bd3eb72913fe","note:permission-view:d0899e9daac170f51b0c34cf189397bd1c4d7fcaf27849e1e5d2701b7bdf2f04","note:permission-view:172af485c6af574f184db2e1921903b4ff3fec1559d585ed50a29b84b3f53600","note:permission-view:b668e47c425857aba9481ba83cd3e8fe0fdfbb2b69e56eca8b03f197810c3ac0"],"query_scope":"authenticated-requester-only"},"output":{"action":"answer","answer":"For pain, use acetaminophen 650 milligrams every six hours as needed, keeping the total under 3,000 milligrams in a day. For nausea, start doxylamine 12.5 milligrams at bedtime and pyridoxine 25 milligrams twice a day. Stop ibuprofen completely. Continue your prenatal vitamin and levothyroxine 75 micrograms every morning.","answer_structured":{"continue":["prenatal vitamin","levothyroxine 75 mcg every morning"],"nausea":{"medications":[{"dose":"12.5 mg","frequency":"at bedtime","name":"doxylamine"},{"dose":"25 mg","frequency":"twice a day","name":"pyridoxine"}]},"pain":{"dose":"650 mg","frequency":"every 6 hours as needed","max_daily_dose":"3,000 mg","medication":"acetaminophen"},"stop":["ibuprofen"]},"retrieved_memory":[{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:491de3c4a78abf9bd9a459e6bf3255dce9f1d78c3c8071ea708ad7a2d3cad8bf","text":"For pain, use acetaminophen instead: 650 milligrams every six hours as needed, and keep the total under 3,000 milligrams in a day."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:46280bd68d8894022f9da7ee6d2a2b6ff1225bd50306c191b0b8cc48f05ca5dc","text":"Medication plan after initial clinician review: stop ibuprofen; use acetaminophen 650 mg q6h PRN with 3,000 mg/day max; continue prenatal vitamin and levothyroxine 75 mcg daily; start doxylamine 12.5 mg nightly and pyridoxine 25 mg BID."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:288f492ee68e44fa8af8781dd45355d4f9915827f425e654147f7e4c8e7e21fd","text":"Let's start doxylamine 12.5 milligrams at bedtime and pyridoxine 25 milligrams twice a day."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:cd03d54976b7febdc138b56ae91ff5b9c5847bb86438e1bc554beb845e925887","text":"Mostly morning nausea, no vomiting, but it has been getting more noticeable this week."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:525999dfd97f9712b8e22f5dc2056027acfdcc73c4202ab66937ee4cce94af7a","text":"Continue your prenatal vitamin and continue levothyroxine 75 micrograms every morning."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:9a41ed9af9d3e83e92ff343b498dd4e5b523de01e88f9fb4fddc59ff1efe4f05","text":"Elena, because of the bleeding, I want you to stop ibuprofen completely."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:b4369dc8c1959d8dc2a25157b83c6411afc8e64bb68ed934c7cd17ddab26fd6a","text":"I'm taking a prenatal vitamin and levothyroxine 75 micrograms each morning. I also took ibuprofen last night before the ED visit."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:145ed19f02d014fb865a1c169074102f25413a3916a76636676008024deffd07","text":"Triage note posted: bleeding light, pain 4/10, no syncope, no fever, no unilateral severe pain, sulfa rash allergy documented."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:539ceb44b29d7d5a7cf74514cdd4123fce5306aa741a8e86a5ded267c9d1dc2e","text":"Sulfa antibiotics give me a blotchy rash."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:304d64e93c32e196ae14ac5070addb2eadd358aa3df68ba25a44a4da55a8d07f","text":"No shoulder pain or fever. The cramps are there, but they're not severe and they're on both sides."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:05e41a3da6511f25f5cd5765551a97778be7cf12d299582d639f9e961fb208b1","text":"I had light bleeding and cramping. The ED ultrasound showed a gestational sac but they said it might just be too early to say more."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:7f17213a7f4fa2b759257b8bc0d48f5b04438c379d4c2ea21d8927cbf0f7f107","text":"I share a family phone plan and I don't want anyone hearing a voicemail that mentions pregnancy or a scan."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:4b93d6818bfbabfbe330ac3b0276df3411cfa934f12d8afdaaf4bd3eb72913fe","text":"I'm drawing the ordered labs now: beta-hCG, CBC, type and screen, and a basic urine sample."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:d0899e9daac170f51b0c34cf189397bd1c4d7fcaf27849e1e5d2701b7bdf2f04","text":"Please keep the clinical details private. She can help me get to the appointments, but that's all."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:172af485c6af574f184db2e1921903b4ff3fec1559d585ed50a29b84b3f53600","text":"The ED told me to come to the early pregnancy clinic because I've had spotting and cramping since last night."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:b668e47c425857aba9481ba83cd3e8fe0fdfbb2b69e56eca8b03f197810c3ac0","text":"Confidentiality support note added by social work: use temporary callback 415-555-0186 for urgent live contact; detailed updates should go through portal messaging when possible."}],"used_record_ids":["note:permission-view:491de3c4a78abf9bd9a459e6bf3255dce9f1d78c3c8071ea708ad7a2d3cad8bf","note:permission-view:46280bd68d8894022f9da7ee6d2a2b6ff1225bd50306c191b0b8cc48f05ca5dc","note:permission-view:288f492ee68e44fa8af8781dd45355d4f9915827f425e654147f7e4c8e7e21fd","note:permission-view:9a41ed9af9d3e83e92ff343b498dd4e5b523de01e88f9fb4fddc59ff1efe4f05","note:permission-view:525999dfd97f9712b8e22f5dc2056027acfdcc73c4202ab66937ee4cce94af7a"]}}
