 Park may receive appointment time/location logistics through Friday, March 6 only. No labs, symptoms, clinical interpretation, or medication details."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:11db5dc7bf3f92ae8dd0b30b844d9954688cac8ef4e178d7bad50152c25a9f33","text":"Yes, Thursday at 8:10 works."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:980749831436cd752ed8f1393469b6a083c40b6e62f68d05127b53df909e09e3","text":"Book that for now."}],"used_record_ids":[]}}
