en canceled. You do not need another routine beta-hCG before the next visit unless your symptoms worsen. If you experience soaking two pads an hour, fainting, fever, or severe one-sided pain, go to the emergency department.","answer_structured":{"appointments":[{"date":"2024-03-10","provider":null,"time":"09:20","type":"ultrasound"},{"date":"2024-03-10","provider":"Dr. Shah","time":"10:30","type":"clinician_visit"}],"canceled_appointments":[{"date":"2024-03-11","provider":"Dr. Shah","time":"15:10","type":"clinic_follow_up"}],"emergency_instructions":"Go to ED if soaking two pads/hour, fainting, fever, or severe one-sided pain.","lab_instructions":"No routine beta-hCG required before next visit unless symptoms worsen."},"retrieved_memory":[{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:f124aa92a5c307f77d74995979fc7f8b96083d1c216e35ff2837de0c0327d6ab","text":"Current plan summary: repeat beta-hCG Thursday March 5 at 8:10 AM; ultrasound Friday March 6 at 11:20 AM with 11:00 AM arrival; clinic follow-up Wednesday March 11 at 3:10 PM."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:b508d50a821a0ee55f786a534b2ef9f4cae95df638861ba1d0fe9a7f44e26e2d","text":"Current follow-up schedule overwritten: Tuesday March 10 ultrasound 9:20 AM and Tuesday March 10 clinician visit 10:30 AM are active; prior Wednesday March 11 3:10 PM visit canceled."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:49e1304b945e0de72d8b48f78dea57f7d2fd82d844d0717d246eebbdfda2cf20","text":"I booked Tuesday March 10 at 9:20 AM for ultrasound and Tuesday March 10 at 10:30 AM with Dr. Shah. The old Wednesday March 11 at 3:10 PM follow-up is canceled."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:efb42f3a60a2c5ba95ba82e3cd910ec96094a452ba13d4c8ff535b95da108fa0","text":"The next step is a repeat ultrasound on Tuesday, March 10 at 9:20 AM, followed by an in-person visit with me at 10:30 AM the same day."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:19ddcef7ecddd176b903d9466c3635c6fbbf0d62ca4c11b9b4ac9f67e8d3a1d8","text":"Because the pregnancy is in the uterus, you do not need another routine beta-hCG before the next visit unless symptoms worsen."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:421f7a69054b58507c2561a858f29940e77806a34f49e5c7fb231540b5d516f7","text":"I also booked a clinic follow-up with Dr. Shah for Wednesday, March 11 at 3:10 PM after the repeat imaging."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:096da7a2206a50b8b3b65a35866831bcb19a586008170e492a50a6bd2dabfffe","text":"Given the slower rise and the symptom change, keep the Friday scan. If you soak two pads an hour, faint, get a fever, or have severe one-sided pain, go to the ED."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:d49a04003e5bb0d036599b675c02a5f7299dcc279550a2401e434dc1ab881045","text":"At this stage we often need serial labs and a follow-up scan before we can say whether the pregnancy is progressing normally."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:9600e624232c321237ae08ff474266cc9c47e353088a3518beacecdbbd09ef5d","text":"Imaging schedule updated: Friday March 6, 11:20 AM ultrasound in Women's Imaging Suite 2 with 11:00 AM arrival; prior Monday March 9, 9:00 AM slot canceled."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:b321dda2127be25e56c653d0d72c747b4ef2baa2fa48744c8f5b0e5580cb3eb2","text":"I reviewed the preliminary scan. The pregnancy is in the uterus, which is reassuring for location, but the scan is still too early to call viability."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:5f995b9562be957898c9c20fa26017229488029e4c086a74275ee8a6cb597660","text":"Radiology just opened an earlier scan slot on Friday, March 6 at 11:20 AM."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:b06a5af60a70078d6738a097f844d1731c0de771ea9776883ae010581c6bdb5b","text":"Friday imaging reminder: March 6 at 11:20 AM, arrive by 11:00 AM, Women's Imaging Suite 2. Bring photo ID; no special bladder prep is needed."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:0ab19897c77c1815a5ae72c05a1bf5008901419014ebf246040647795cea12a2","text":"Done. Friday, March 6 ultrasound at 11:20 AM, arrive by 11:00 AM to Women's Imaging Suite 2. Monday's 9:00 AM slot is canceled."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:c1f36e85ce42bfbcfb7f70ccc25c67c53e4b84e9649072733641968fe732fbbf","text":"ultrasound Friday March 6 at 11:20 AM with 11:00 AM arrival"},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:3a3282476d8ba150993b14fbe878aa064df0aa154139bef5b91a37b94364e142","text":"Yes, please. Just the appointment time, no diagnosis."},{"memory_id":"note:permission-view:5a0c8584ae12b644fcbed8581d6d879a5aa04d90793f1616f2ccbb2c182571b3","text":"For imaging, I have Monday, March 9 at 9:00 AM in Women's Imaging Suite 2."}],"used_record_ids":["note:permission-view:b508d50a821a0ee55f786a534b2ef9f4cae95df638861ba1d0fe9a7f44e26e2d","note:permission-view:49e1304b945e0de72d8b48f78dea57f7d2fd82d844d0717d246eebbdfda2cf20","note:permission-view:efb42f3a60a2c5ba95ba82e3cd910ec96094a452ba13d4c8ff535b95da108fa0","note:permission-view:19ddcef7ecddd176b903d9466c3635c6fbbf0d62ca4c11b9b4ac9f67e8d3a1d8","note:permission-view:096da7a2206a50b8b3b65a35866831bcb19a586008170e492a50a6bd2dabfffe"]}}
